# Uconnect VP4 (RA4) – Original ActionScript Sources

## Overview

This repository contains the original English-language ActionScript 3 (AS3) code extracted and decompiled from the FCA/Harman Uconnect VP4 (RA4) infotainment system, firmware version **18.45.01 (North America)**.

The code originates from the factory Adobe Flash/AIR-based Human Machine Interface (HMI) used in Uconnect 8.4-inch infotainment systems.

## Technical Information

- **Platform:** FCA / Harman Uconnect VP4 (RA4)
- **Firmware:** 18.45.01 (NA)
- **Operating System:** QNX Neutrino 6.5
- **HMI:** Adobe Flash / AIR
- **Programming Language:** ActionScript 3.0
- **Source:** Factory SWF files, decompiled using JPEXS FFDec
- **Language:** English (original North American version)

## Purpose

This repository is intended for research, reverse engineering, documentation, and development related to the Uconnect VP4 platform.

The extracted code can be used to study:

- Original HMI architecture and user interface logic
- Menu structures, navigation, and system settings
- Localization and language resources
- Communication between HMI components
- Development of custom UI features and modifications

## Important Notes

The files represent decompiled factory code, not the original Adobe development project. Some source-level information may have been lost during compilation and decompilation.

No Hungarian translations, custom menus, Speed Lockout modifications, or other aftermarket changes are included.

